# The banner cube renders in a sandboxed iframe with no allow-same-origin, so
# its document origin is `null`. The renderer requests every face with
# crossOrigin="anonymous" (the texture shim needs origin-clean images to
# rasterise an unsupported source), and a null origin makes that a
# cross-origin request even for our own asset. ordinals.com served these with
# `access-control-allow-origin: *`, which is the only reason the banner worked
# before they were self-hosted.
#
# Scoped to the banner's own directory: nothing else is readable cross-origin.
/assets/banner/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
